%% aoneahsan-cccs-capacitor — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Capacitor work]) --> task{What are you doing?}

    task -->|adding Capacitor| add[yarn add @capacitor/core @capacitor/cli<br/>then npx cap add android]
    add --> appid[Set appId from the domain reversed<br/>and ANNOTATE it as permanent —<br/>a published id cannot change<br/>without orphaning every user]
    appid --> ts

    task -->|editing capacitor.config.ts| env[/🔴 THE ENV TRAP/]
    env --> reads{Does the config read<br/>any VITE_ or env value?}
    reads -->|yes| loader["Add the process.loadEnvFile loop.<br/>The CLI requires this file in a plain<br/>Node process — Vite never runs during<br/>cap sync, so nothing populates<br/>process.env, and import.meta.env<br/>does not exist there at all"]
    loader --> order{Is .env.local listed BEFORE .env?}
    order -->|no| fixorder[Reorder. loadEnvFile is FIRST-WINS,<br/>so the most specific file must<br/>come first to match Vite]
    order -->|yes| guard{Guarded with existsSync?}
    fixorder --> guard
    guard -->|no| addguard[Add it — loadEnvFile throws ENOENT<br/>on a missing file]
    guard -->|yes| loud
    addguard --> loud
    loud[Throw in the config when a required<br/>value is missing — names the VARIABLE,<br/>never the value]
    reads -->|no| ts
    loud --> ts

    ts{TypeScript version?}
    ts -->|7.x| pin[Pin ~6.0.3. cap sync transpiles<br/>this config through the TS JS API,<br/>which TS7 removed]
    ts -->|6.x| sync
    pin --> sync

    task -->|running cap sync| sync[npx cap sync android]
    sync --> verify[/VERIFY THE GENERATED FILE,<br/>not the source/]
    verify --> check["grep the value in<br/>android/app/src/main/assets/capacitor.config.json"]
    check --> empty{Is any value empty?}
    empty -->|yes| back[The env loader is wrong.<br/>typecheck and lint will NOT catch this —<br/>the config is outside tsconfig.include<br/>and the lint ignores]
    back --> loader
    empty -->|no| ok[Config is correct]

    task -->|web vs native behaviour| branch["Branch on Capacitor.isNativePlatform<br/>AT THE CALL SITE"]
    branch --> nosilent[Never inside a helper with a silent<br/>fallback — that is how a web user<br/>clicks Share and nothing happens]

    task -->|content behind the<br/>status/nav bars| insets{How many inset owners?}
    insets -->|two| conflict[Content renders behind the bars.<br/>Pick ONE]
    insets -->|zero| conflict
    insets -->|one| insetok[Correct: either the edge-to-edge plugin<br/>WITH core SystemBars insets disabled,<br/>OR env safe-area-inset with<br/>viewport-fit=cover]
    conflict --> insetok

    ok --> done
    nosilent --> done
    insetok --> done
    done([Build, then verify on a real device])

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class task,reads,order,guard,ts,empty,insets gateNode
    class trigger,done terminal
    class env,verify,back,conflict warn
